172 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 112 0 R
/T (Sensoria utilizes a 100% custom 3D-printed chassis rather than an off-the-shelf structural frame. A custom robot base enhances structural strength by optimizing material distribution specifically for our competition layout, directly improving overall stability, durability, and power routing. Designing our own chassis also allowed us to tailor specific mounting features and cable channels to our exact dimensions, making the vehicle far better suited for the high-speed maneuvers of the WRO track compared to mass-produced bases.)
/E (Sensoria utilizes a 100% custom 3D-printed chassis rather than an off-the-shelf structural frame. A custom robot base enhances structural strength by optimizing material distribution specifically for our competition layout, directly improving overall stability, durability, and power routing. Designing our own chassis also allowed us to tailor specific mounting features and cable channels to our exact dimensions, making the vehicle far better suited for the high-speed maneuvers of the WRO track compared to mass-produced bases.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
